.TH METASCORE 1
.SH NAME
metascore \\- score filesystem metadata changes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B metascore
metascore index|check [--root DIRECTORY] [--state FILE]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Saves or compares a metadata and extended-attribute-name baseline for a directory tree.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBmetascore --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
